        "text": "∀ k, ∃ C > 0, ∀ lam …, |correctionJet c amp k eta y| ≤ C * Real.exp (-(1 / (4 * lam))) * (1 + |amp eta|) ∧ ∀ amp', HasDerivAt amp amp' eta → |deriv (fun t => correctionJet c amp k t y) eta| ≤ C * exp(-(1/(4*lam))) * (1 + |amp'|)"
